<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you join the mailing list, join the book waiting list, send a speaking invitation or write to the office, we collect the details you enter in the form. This can include your name, email address, phone number and message.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To reply to your message or invitation.</li>
      <li>To tell you when the book is available, if you joined the waiting list.</li>
      <li>To send the updates you asked for. Every email includes a way to unsubscribe.</li>
      <li>We never sell your details or share them for marketing.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Where your details are kept</h2>
    <p>Your details are held securely in the email service we use to send messages and to keep our mailing lists. They are used by Pastor Bola’s team only.</p>
    <h2>Buying the e-book</h2>
    <p>Payments are taken by Korapay on its own secure page. We never see or store your card details. We keep the name and email address you give us only to send your download link and to help if something goes wrong.</p>
    <h2>Embedded videos</h2>
    <p>Videos open in YouTube’s privacy-enhanced mode and only load when you choose to play them.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>To ask about or remove your data, use the <a class="link" href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
